---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Resources"
	description="Trustworthy organizations and services for seniors, their families, and caregivers."
>
	<article class="aw-container aw-section">
		<h1>Resources</h1>
		<div class="aw-article-body">
			<p>Trustworthy organizations and services for seniors, their families, and caregivers — organized by what you need, not by category jargon.</p>

			<h2>In a crisis</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline</strong> — Call or text <strong>988</strong> anytime, day or night, for a mental health crisis, including thoughts of suicide. <a href="https://988lifeline.org/">988lifeline.org</a></li>
				<li><strong>Alzheimer's Association 24/7 Helpline</strong> — <strong>1-800-272-3900</strong>. Free, confidential support for people living with dementia, their families, and caregivers, available around the clock.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Finding local services</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Eldercare Locator</strong> — A public service of the U.S. Administration on Aging that connects you with local aging services by ZIP code. Call <strong>1-800-677-1116</strong> or visit <a href="https://eldercare.acl.gov/">eldercare.acl.gov</a>.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Dementia & cognitive care</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Alzheimer's Association</strong> — Research, caregiver guidance, local chapters, and the 24/7 Helpline above. <a href="https://www.alz.org/">alz.org</a></li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Caregiver support</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Family Caregiver Alliance</strong> — Education, support groups, and policy resources specifically for family caregivers. <a href="https://www.caregiver.org/">caregiver.org</a></li>
				<li><strong>National Council on Aging (NCOA)</strong> — Benefits checkups, caregiver resources, and healthy aging programs. <a href="https://www.ncoa.org/">ncoa.org</a></li>
				<li><strong>ARCH National Respite Network and Resource Center</strong> — Directory and guidance for finding respite care in your area. <a href="https://archrespite.org/">archrespite.org</a></li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Mental health</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>National Institute on Aging</strong> — Government research-backed information on depression, cognitive health, and aging. <a href="https://www.nia.nih.gov/">nia.nih.gov</a></li>
			</ul>

			<hr />
			<p><em>Know a resource that should be here? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a> — this list is reviewed periodically. See our <a href="/editorial-policy/">Editorial Policy</a> for how we vet what we link to.</em></p>
		</div>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>
